{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "CosmosAI learning export", "elements": [{"id": "title", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 40, "width": 1100, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000011, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a1", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Milestone 47: PyTorch Dataset/DataLoader Proof", "fontSize": 34, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Milestone 47: PyTorch Dataset/DataLoader Proof", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "subtitle", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 98, "width": 1280, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000002, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000021, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/#concept-pytorch-dataset-dataloader", "locked": false, "index": "a2", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept: Dataset returns one item; DataLoader stacks items into a batch.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept: Dataset returns one item; DataLoader stacks items into a batch.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "samples-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 170, "width": 360, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000031, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a3", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "samples-text", "type": "text", "x": 84, "y": 194, "width": 310, "height": 160, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000004, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000041, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a4", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "GalaxyTrainingSample list\n\nExisting project objects:\nimage_id\nlabel\nlabel_id\ntensor values\n\nExample labels:\n[spiral, lenticular]", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "GalaxyTrainingSample list\n\nExisting project objects:\nimage_id\nlabel\nlabel_id\ntensor values\n\nExample labels:\n[spiral, lenticular]", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "dataset-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 520, "y": 170, "width": 390, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000005, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000051, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a5", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "dataset-text", "type": "text", "x": 546, "y": 194, "width": 335, "height": 160, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000006, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000061, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a6", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "GalaxyTorchDataset\n\nPurpose:\nwrap our samples in the PyTorch Dataset interface.\n\n__len__(): sample count\n__getitem__(): one item", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "GalaxyTorchDataset\n\nPurpose:\nwrap our samples in the PyTorch Dataset interface.\n\n__len__(): sample count\n__getitem__(): one item", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "getitem-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1010, "y": 170, "width": 410, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000071, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a7", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "getitem-text", "type": "text", "x": 1036, "y": 194, "width": 355, "height": 160, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000008, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000081, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a8", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "__getitem__(index)\n\nReturns one example:\nimage_tensor shape (3, 3, 3)\nlabel_tensor tensor(1)\n\nConcept: one sample,\nnot a batch yet.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "__getitem__(index)\n\nReturns one example:\nimage_tensor shape (3, 3, 3)\nlabel_tensor tensor(1)\n\nConcept: one sample,\nnot a batch yet.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "dataloader-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1520, "y": 170, "width": 420, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f3d9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000009, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000091, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a9", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "dataloader-text", "type": "text", "x": 1546, "y": 194, "width": 365, "height": 160, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000010, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000101, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a10", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "create_galaxy_dataloader()\n\nUses torch.utils.data.DataLoader.\n\nDataLoader asks Dataset for items\nand stacks them into batches.\n\nshuffle=False for stable proof.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "create_galaxy_dataloader()\n\nUses torch.utils.data.DataLoader.\n\nDataLoader asks Dataset for items\nand stacks them into batches.\n\nshuffle=False for stable proof.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "batch-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 520, "y": 520, "width": 520, "height": 260, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000011, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000111, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a11", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "batch-text", "type": "text", "x": 548, "y": 548, "width": 455, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000012, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000121, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a12", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "preview_first_dataloader_batch()\n\nPulls one batch from DataLoader.\n\nObserved tiny output:\nimage_tensor_shape = (2, 3, 3, 3)\nlabel_tensor_shape = (2,)\nlabel_ids = [1, 2]", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "preview_first_dataloader_batch()\n\nPulls one batch from DataLoader.\n\nObserved tiny output:\nimage_tensor_shape = (2, 3, 3, 3)\nlabel_tensor_shape = (2,)\nlabel_ids = [1, 2]", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "manual-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1160, "y": 520, "width": 520, "height": 260, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe8cc", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000013, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 470000131, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a13", "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"id": "manual-text", "type": "text", "x": 1188, "y": 548, "width": 455, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000014, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 470000141, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a14", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Manual batch proof\n\ngalaxy_samples_to_torch_batch()\n\nOur code stacks samples directly.\n\nDataLoader proof should match this shape,\nbut DataLoader is the normal PyTorch path.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Manual batch proof\n\ngalaxy_samples_to_torch_batch()\n\nOur code stacks samples directly.\n\nDataLoader proof should match this shape,\nbut DataLoader is the normal PyTorch path.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "concept-dataset", "type": "text", "x": 520, "y": 410, "width": 420, "height": 26, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000015, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000151, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/#concept-pytorch-dataset", "locked": false, "index": "a15", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept doc: Dataset", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept doc: Dataset", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "concept-dataloader", "type": "text", "x": 1520, "y": 410, "width": 420, "height": 26, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 47000016, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 470000161, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1787060000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/#concept-pytorch-dataloader", "locked": false, "index": "a16", "hasTextLink": true, "text": "Concept doc: DataLoader", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Concept doc: DataLoader", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoRes